---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="走丢了 · SamsBlog" description="这里没有你要找的页面。">
  <section class="not-found shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 · Lost frame</p>
    <h1>这一帧，<em>不在胶卷里。</em></h1>
    <p>链接可能已经改变，也可能从未存在。回到首页，继续看下一段故事吧。</p>
    <a class="button button--primary" href="/">回到首页</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    min-height: 72vh;
    padding-block: calc(var(--header-height) + 48px) 64px;
    display: grid;
    place-content: center;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 50rem;
  }

  h1 { max-width: 12ch; }
  h1 em { color: var(--accent); font-style: italic; }
  p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 34rem; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
